            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0SD4ZNFN6QXN9Z6N140SGNK>
              Kind, FQN, eidolon.ai/v1 apiVersion and canonical bytes match the mission decision exactly.
              </?01M0SD4ZNFN6QXN9Z6N140SGNK>
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0SD4ZNFN6QXN9Z6N140SGNM>
              Binding uses typed stable Holon member/role refs and the exact closed ai-agent|human-endpoint|service|hybrid adapter union; a carried snapshot must have the canonical HolonEffectiveSnapshot kind plus valid issuer receipt.
              </?01M0SD4ZNFN6QXN9Z6N140SGNM>
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC3 { checked = true } ?01M0SD4ZNFN6QXN9Z6N140SGNN>
              principalKind never selects or rejects an adapter automatically; missing/ambiguous adapter refs and empty, duplicate, cyclic or unresolved hybrid candidates fail closed.
              </?01M0SD4ZNFN6QXN9Z6N140SGNN>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
